<title>SPAIN: Three killed in helicopter crash near Madrid.</title>
<headline>Three killed in helicopter crash near Madrid.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed in a helicopter crash near Madrid on Monday, the Spanish Interior Ministry said.</p>
<p>No further details were available. The cause of the crash was immediately known. Spanish media reports said the helicopter was used for commercial purposes.</p>
</text>
